      - unfold DUSC_STACK, CREATE_SSVC_STACK, MAKE_SHARED_IMPL_STACK, SHCOUNT_CTOR_STACK, ROPNEW_STACK, RMALLOC_STACK. lia.
      - rewrite EA. exact ERR.
