    clear DUS. intros [ms2 mo2] PO. unfold do_use_service_create_post in PO. cbn [cfg_ms cfg_model] in PO.
    destruct PO as (w0 & w1 & w2 & e1 & e2 & e3 & e4 & e5 & e6 & e7 & w3 & w4 & w5 & w6 & m2 & errv2 & sB & p1 & v & p2 & q &
                    -> & KREL2 & MP2 & MI2 & ST2 & ERR2 & AUX2 & BRV & BRQ & HEAP2 & REG2 & SSVC2 & IMPL2 & AI2 & XS2 & XP2).
